    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nElegant Two-Bedroom Apartment in the Heart of Dún Laoghaire\nSituated in the vibrant heart of Dún Laoghaire, this superb two-bedroom apartment presents a rare opportunity to acquire a stylish coastal residence with a truly distinctive outlook. Combining contemporary comfort with an enviable location, the property is ideally suited to those seeking a well-appointed home within walking distance of every conceivable amenity.\nA standout feature of this exceptional apartment is its striking semi-circular window, an architectural highlight that floods the living space with natural light while framing uninterrupted views down Marine Road towards the harbour. This beautiful focal point creates an ever-changing coastal backdrop and lends a unique sense of character and charm to the home.\nThe accommodation is both spacious and well-balanced, comprising a bright living/dining room, a modern fitted kitchen, utility/storage room, two generously sized bedrooms, and a well-appointed bathroom. Solid wood flooring runs throughout, enhancing the sense of warmth and cohesion while complementing the apartment's clean, contemporary finish.\nBoth bedrooms enjoy direct access to a private, sunny balcony—an ideal retreat for relaxing or entertaining while taking full advantage of the apartment's bright and tranquil aspect.\nThis apartment also has a rear entrance onto Cantwell Lane where there is also a communal lock up storage unit for the three apartments.\nPerfectly positioned, the property benefits from immediate access to an array of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, and the popular seafront promenade. Excellent transport links, including the DART and multiple bus routes, provide seamless connectivity to Dublin city centre and beyond and the AirCoach straight to Dublin airport.\n\nA distinctive and highly appealing home offering comfort, style, and a truly special coastal outlook."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance hall: - \nChevron wooden flooring, central light, intercom\n\nLiving/kitchen/dining - \n\n\nKitchen: - 5.65m x 6.21m\nfloor and eyelevel cabinets, central light, stainless steel sink unit, integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge freezer, integrated electric oven and hob, extractor fan\n\nLiving room: - \nfeature semi circular window over looking Marine Road and down to the Harbour, Chevron wood flooring, central lights, built-in media unit, storage, central light\n\nBedroom one: - 4.73m x 2.89m max\nChevron wood flooring, built wardrobes, central light, double room, sliding patio doors to private balcony\n\nBedroom two: - 3.47m max x 3.39m\nChevron wood flooring, built-in wardrobe, central light ,door to balcony area\n\nShower room: - \ncentral light, corner shower suite, WC, wash handbasin\n\nBalcony/patio area: - \npaving slabs with fencing\n\nGarden: - \nPrivate balcony/patio area\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Prime central location in Dún Laoghaire</li><li> Stunning semi-circular feature window with harbour views</li><li> Bright and spacious two-bedroom accommodation</li><li> Solid wood flooring throughout</li><li> Private sunny balcony with access from both bedrooms</li><li> Electric heating BER A3</li><li> Walking distance to seafront, DART, and a wide range of amenities</ul>"
